--
-- Machining - Obround Slot Milling, Slotting Depth Ratio = 1. The Uddeholm Corrax end milling
-- table pasted on the Machining calculator workbook (memory/Machining - Calculator Database
-- (1).xlsx) Slot Milling sheet (memory/Slot Milling .png): 'Slot milling, Axial depth of cut, ap =
-- 1 x D', as the Slot Milling calculator takes it (migration 1157): a keyway is cut full width by
-- an end mill of its width. Mitsubishi Materials ('Depth of cut',
-- mmc-carbide.com/permanent/courses/70/depth-of-cut.html) gives up to 1 x D for semi-finishing and
-- roughing edges.
--
-- Machining - End Facing, Faces = 2. the Machining calculator workbook (memory/Machining -
-- Calculator Database (1).xlsx), Facing sheet: No of uses 2, both ends of the part (Facing!K4).
--
-- Machining - End Facing, Depth of Cut = 0.5. the Machining calculator workbook (memory/Machining
