-- (Threading!G12).
--
-- Machining - Thread Turning, Passes = 4. the Machining calculator workbook (memory/Machining -
-- Calculator Database (1).xlsx), Threading sheet: 4 passes (Threading!G15).
--
-- Machining - Thread Turning, Max Spindle Speed. The selected machine's own top spindle speed
-- (mhr_records.specs spindle_speed_rpm, migration 1136, from memory/machining/machine). The
