    VALUES (NULL, $q$Machining - Rigid Tapping$q$, 'process', 'single', false, true, true, $q$Rigid tapping, as the Machining calculator workbook's Tapping sheet times it, corrected: n = 1000 v / (pi D) at the thread's nominal diameter, capped at the machine's spindle limit; the feed is the thread pitch (a tap advances one pitch a turn; the sheet's 0.25 mm/rev and its 122 m/min table are a drilling cut); the tap goes in and back out over the thread depth + 4 mm; rounded up to whole seconds a thread. Cutting speed is the sheet's own HSS tapping speed for the material (Tapping!A33:D58), a range picked at the Range Position. The tap's wear is the line's tool cost: Rs 498.4 a tap, the middle of the Rs 36.02 - 960.85 the workbook pictures a tap at (the supplier listing on its Knurling and Threading sheets; the workbook prices its drill, insert holder and end mill at the middle of their pictured ranges), over the 300 parts a tool lasts on those two sheets; one tap for each thread size. (No tool cost until migration 1157.)$q$)
    RETURNING id INTO v_id;
  ELSE
    UPDATE public.calculators SET description = $q$Rigid tapping, as the Machining calculator workbook's Tapping sheet times it, corrected: n = 1000 v / (pi D) at the thread's nominal diameter, capped at the machine's spindle limit; the feed is the thread pitch (a tap advances one pitch a turn; the sheet's 0.25 mm/rev and its 122 m/min table are a drilling cut); the tap goes in and back out over the thread depth + 4 mm; rounded up to whole seconds a thread. Cutting speed is the sheet's own HSS tapping speed for the material (Tapping!A33:D58), a range picked at the Range Position. The tap's wear is the line's tool cost: Rs 498.4 a tap, the middle of the Rs 36.02 - 960.85 the workbook pictures a tap at (the supplier listing on its Knurling and Threading sheets; the workbook prices its drill, insert holder and end mill at the middle of their pictured ranges), over the 300 parts a tool lasts on those two sheets; one tap for each thread size. (No tool cost until migration 1157.)$q$, updated_at = now() WHERE id = v_id;
